#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#. Author of the plugin
#: kledo.php includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:63
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:206
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:207
msgid "Kledo"
msgstr "Kledo"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: kledo.php
msgid "https://github.com/Kledo-ID/wc-kledo"
msgstr "https://github.com/Kledo-ID/wc-kledo"

#. Description of the plugin
#: kledo.php
msgid ""
"Integrates <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" target=\"_blank\" "
">WooCommerce</a> with the <a href=\"https://kledo.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Kledo</a> accounting software."
msgstr ""
"Hubungkan <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" target=\"_blank\" "
">WooCommerce</a> dengan software akuntansi <a href=\"https://kledo.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Kledo</a>."

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: kledo.php
msgid "https://kledo.com"
msgstr "https://kledo.com"

#: includes/abstracts/class-wc-kledo-request.php:233
msgid ""
"Can't do API request because the api key & endpoint url has not been "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Tidak dapat melakukan permintaan API karena API key & API Endpoint belum "
"diatur."

#: includes/abstracts/class-wc-kledo-request.php:269
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-transactions.php:2221
msgid "There was a problem when connecting to the API."
msgstr "Terjadi masalah pada saat menghubungkan ke API."

#: includes/abstracts/class-wc-kledo-settings-screen.php:78
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Simpan perubahan"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:111
msgid "Not sent to Kledo"
msgstr "Belum dikirim ke Kledo"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:143
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "Tertutup"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:144
msgid ""
"Kledo has closed its sales order for this order; every quantity has been "
"invoiced."
msgstr ""
"Kledo sudah menutup pesanan penjualan untuk order ini; seluruh kuantitas "
"telah ditagihkan."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:153
msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "Menunggu"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:154
msgid ""
"The invoice reached Kledo and the plugin is waiting for Kledo to finish "
"processing it and close the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan sudah sampai di Kledo dan plugin sedang menunggu Kledo selesai "
"memprosesnya lalu menutup pesanan penjualannya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:161
msgid "Check Kledo"
msgstr "Cek di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:162
msgid ""
"The plugin stopped waiting for Kledo to close the sales order. Open the "
"order to read why, then check it in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Plugin berhenti menunggu Kledo menutup pesanan penjualan. Buka order ini "
"untuk membaca alasannya, lalu periksa di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:169
msgid "Not linked"
msgstr "Tidak ditautkan"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:170
msgid ""
"The invoice was sent without a link to the sales order. The sales order "
"never registered it, its quantities do not count as billed, and it stays "
"open in Kledo until you close it there."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan dikirim tanpa tautan ke pesanan penjualan. Pesanan penjualannya "
"tidak pernah mencatat tagihan ini, kuantitasnya tidak terhitung tertagih, "
"dan pesanan itu tetap terbuka di Kledo sampai Anda menutupnya di sana."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:177
msgid "Left open"
msgstr "Dibiarkan terbuka"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:178
msgid ""
"The invoice is linked to the sales order and its quantities count as billed, "
"but Kledo was asked not to close the sales order at the time. Kledo closes "
"it anyway once anything makes it recalculate that sales order."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan tertaut ke pesanan penjualan dan kuantitasnya terhitung tertagih, "
"tetapi Kledo diminta untuk tidak menutup pesanan penjualannya saat itu. "
"Kledo tetap akan menutupnya begitu ada hal yang membuatnya menghitung ulang "
"pesanan penjualan itu."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:185
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Terkirim"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-column.php:186
msgid ""
"The invoice was sent to Kledo. There is no confirmation on record that the "
"sales order was closed."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan sudah dikirim ke Kledo. Belum ada catatan konfirmasi bahwa pesanan "
"penjualannya tertutup."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:79
msgid "Kledo sync"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi Kledo"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:100
msgid "You do not have permission to sync this order to Kledo."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk menyinkronkan pesanan ini ke Kledo."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:122
msgid "Re-sending may create a duplicate sales order in Kledo. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Mengirim ulang dapat membuat duplikasi pesanan penjualan di Kledo. Lanjutkan?"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:123
msgid "Re-sending may create a duplicate invoice in Kledo. Continue?"
msgstr "Mengirim ulang dapat membuat duplikasi tagihan di Kledo. Lanjutkan?"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:127
msgid ""
"Manual actions match plugin rules: sales order when the order is Processing "
"(same lifecycle as automatic sync on Processing); invoice only when the "
"order is Completed. Re-send appears only after a successful sync."
msgstr ""
"Aksi manual mengikuti aturan plugin: pesanan penjualan saat status pesanan "
"Processing (sama seperti sinkronisasi otomatis); tagihan hanya saat status "
"Completed. Kirim ulang hanya tersedia setelah sinkronisasi berhasil."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:145
msgid "Re-send sales order to Kledo"
msgstr "Kirim ulang pesanan penjualan ke Kledo"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:153
msgid "Send sales order to Kledo (first manual)"
msgstr "Kirim pesanan penjualan ke Kledo (manual pertama)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:167
msgid "Re-send invoice to Kledo"
msgstr "Kirim ulang tagihan ke Kledo"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:175
msgid "Send invoice to Kledo (first manual)"
msgstr "Kirim tagihan ke Kledo (manual pertama)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:219
msgid "Both sales order and invoice creation are disabled in Kledo settings."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan pesanan penjualan dan tagihan dinonaktifkan di pengaturan Kledo."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:221
msgid ""
"No manual Kledo actions apply to this order status. Automatic sync still "
"runs on status changes (Processing → sales order, Completed → invoice)."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada aksi manual Kledo untuk status pesanan ini. Sinkronisasi otomatis "
"tetap berjalan saat perubahan status (Processing → pesanan penjualan, "
"Completed → tagihan)."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:242
msgid "Kledo: Re-send sales order (already synced; may duplicate)"
msgstr ""
"Kledo: Kirim ulang pesanan penjualan (sudah tersinkron; berpotensi duplikat)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:244
msgid "Kledo: Send sales order (first manual)"
msgstr "Kledo: Kirim pesanan penjualan (manual pertama)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:250
msgid "Kledo: Re-send invoice (already synced; may duplicate)"
msgstr "Kledo: Kirim ulang tagihan (sudah tersinkron; dapat duplikat)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:252
msgid "Kledo: Send invoice (first manual)"
msgstr "Kirim tagihan ke Kledo (manual pertama)"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:259
msgid "Kledo: Check Kledo status now"
msgstr "Kledo: Periksa status Kledo sekarang"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:330
msgid ""
"Kledo: could not read the order status from Kledo. Check the WooCommerce "
"logs for details."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: tidak bisa membaca status pesanan dari Kledo. Periksa log WooCommerce "
"untuk detailnya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:338
msgid "Kledo: the Kledo sales order is closed. The order has been updated."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pesanan penjualan Kledo sudah tertutup. Pesanan ini sudah diperbarui."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:346
msgid ""
"Kledo: this order will not be closed automatically. See the order notes for "
"the reason."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pesanan ini tidak akan ditutup otomatis. Lihat order note untuk "
"alasannya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:353
msgid ""
"Kledo: the Kledo sales order is not closed yet. The automatic check will "
"keep trying."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pesanan penjualan Kledo belum tertutup. Pemeriksaan otomatis akan "
"terus mencoba."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:373
msgid "You do not have permission to run this action."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk menjalankan tindakan ini."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:384
msgid "Invalid request."
msgstr "Permintaan tidak valid."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:390
msgid "Order not found."
msgstr "Pesanan tidak ditemukan."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:394
msgid "You do not have permission to sync this order."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk menyinkronkan pesanan ini."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:538
msgid ""
"Kledo: manual sales order actions are only available when the order is "
"Processing or Completed."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: aksi manual pesanan penjualan hanya tersedia saat status Processing "
"atau Completed."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:542
msgid ""
"Kledo: manual invoice actions are only available when the order is Completed."
msgstr "Kledo: aksi manual tagihan hanya tersedia saat status Completed."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:545
msgid "Kledo: invalid sync type."
msgstr "Kledo: tipe sinkronisasi tidak valid."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:552
msgid ""
"Kledo: re-send is only available when this record is already marked synced "
"in WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: kirim ulang hanya tersedia jika data ini sudah ditandai tersinkron di "
"WooCommerce."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:555
msgid ""
"Kledo: initial manual send is not available because this is already marked "
"synced. Use the re-send action instead."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pengiriman manual awal tidak tersedia karena sudah tersinkron. "
"Gunakan fitur kirim ulang."

#. translators: %s: order or invoice
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:571
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: %s was sent successfully."
msgstr "Kledo: %s berhasil dikirim."

#. translators: %s: order or invoice
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:580
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: %s is already marked synced. Use the re-send action if you need to "
"push again."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: %s sudah ditandai tersinkron. Gunakan aksi kirim ulang jika perlu "
"mengirim kembali."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:586
msgid "Kledo: API connection is disabled; nothing was sent."
msgstr "Kledo: Koneksi API dinonaktifkan; tidak ada yang dikirim."

#. translators: %s: order or invoice
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:592
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: %s push is disabled in plugin settings."
msgstr "Kledo: Pengiriman %s dinonaktifkan di pengaturan plugin."

#. translators: %s: order or invoice
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:599
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: %s was skipped."
msgstr "Kledo: %s dilewati."

#. translators: 1: type, 2: error
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:607
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: failed to push %1$s — %2$s"
msgstr "Kledo: gagal mengirim %1$s — %2$s"

#. translators: 1: type, 2: HTTP code
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin-order-sync.php:615
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: failed to push %1$s (HTTP %2$d)."
msgstr "Kledo: gagal mengirim %1$s (HTTP %2$d)."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:175
msgid "You do not have permission to save these settings."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk menyimpan pengaturan ini."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:184
msgid "Your settings have been saved."
msgstr "Pengaturan Anda telah disimpan."

#. translators: %s: error message.
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:190
#, php-format
msgid "Your settings could not be saved. %s"
msgstr "Pengaturan tidak dapat disimpan. %s"

