#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:414
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: Kledo accepts this store's API key, but the account it belongs to has "
"no access to that company, so nothing is syncing. The key itself is fine — "
"pasting a new one from the same account will not help. Check that the "
"account still belongs to the company, or save a key made for the right "
"company in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: Kledo menerima API Key toko ini, tetapi akun pemiliknya tidak punya "
"akses ke perusahaan tersebut, jadi tidak ada yang tersinkron. Kuncinya "
"sendiri tidak bermasalah — menempelkan kunci baru dari akun yang sama tidak "
"akan menolong. Pastikan akun itu masih tergabung di perusahaan tersebut, "
"atau simpan kunci yang dibuat untuk perusahaan yang benar di %s."

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:426
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: this store's API key is no longer valid, so nothing is syncing to "
"Kledo right now. It has either expired or been replaced by a newer login. "
"Paste a current API key in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: API Key toko ini sudah tidak berlaku, jadi saat ini tidak ada yang "
"tersinkron ke Kledo. Kunci ini sudah kedaluwarsa atau digantikan oleh login "
"yang lebih baru. Tempelkan API Key yang masih berlaku di %s."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:444
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:642
msgid "WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure"
msgstr "WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure"

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:480
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo normally renews this key by itself while the store keeps syncing, so "
"no action is needed as long as orders are still reaching Kledo. If they are "
"not, the key will run out — and once it does, orders and invoices will stop "
"being sent to Kledo automatically until a current key is saved in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo biasanya memperbarui API Key ini secara otomatis selama toko masih "
"rutin melakukan sinkronisasi, jadi tidak ada yang perlu dilakukan selama "
"order masih sampai ke Kledo. Kalau tidak, masa berlaku API Key akan habis — "
"dan begitu itu terjadi, order dan invoice berhenti dikirim otomatis ke Kledo "
"sampai API Key yang masih berlaku disimpan di %s."

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:486
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key does not renew itself. Once it expires, orders and invoices will "
"stop being sent to Kledo automatically and every sync will keep failing "
"until a current key is saved. Paste a current one in %s before then."
msgstr ""
"API Key ini tidak diperbarui secara otomatis. Begitu masa berlakunya habis, "
"order dan invoice berhenti dikirim otomatis ke Kledo dan setiap sinkronisasi "
"akan terus gagal sampai API Key yang masih berlaku disimpan. Tempelkan API "
"Key yang masih berlaku di %s sebelum tanggal tersebut."

#. translators: 1: number of days, 2: expiry date sentence, 3: what to do about it
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:501
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: this store's API key expires in %1$d day. %2$s %3$s"
msgid_plural "Kledo: this store's API key expires in %1$d days. %2$s %3$s"
msgstr[0] "Kledo: API Key toko ini kedaluwarsa dalam %1$d hari. %2$s %3$s"
msgstr[1] "Kledo: API Key toko ini kedaluwarsa dalam %1$d hari. %2$s %3$s"

#. translators: %s: expiry date and time
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:535
#, php-format
msgid "It expires on %s."
msgstr "Kedaluwarsa pada %s."

#. translators: %s: WooCommerce product name HTML link.
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-loader.php:289
#, php-format
msgid "WooCommerce Kledo requires %s to be installed and active."
msgstr "Diperlukan %s untuk menggunakan WooCommerce Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:186
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close — the maximum wait time "
"was reached. Check the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup — batas waktu tunggu "
"tercapai. Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#. translators: %d: number of attempts made
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:198
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close after %d checks. Check "
"the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup setelah %d kali pemeriksaan. "
"Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:289
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close — Kledo rejected the "
"status request (HTTP %d). Check the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup — Kledo menolak permintaan "
"statusnya (HTTP %d). Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:313
msgid ""
"Kledo: the invoice exists in Kledo but there is no matching Kledo sales "
"order, so there is nothing to close. This is expected when \"Enable Create "
"Order\" is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: tagihannya ada di Kledo tetapi tidak ada pesanan penjualan Kledo yang "
"cocok, jadi tidak ada yang perlu ditutup. Ini wajar ketika \"Enable Create "
"Order\" dimatikan."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:323
msgid ""
"Kledo: the Kledo invoice was created without a link to the Kledo order, so "
"the order will not be closed automatically. This usually means the order "
"items changed between Processing and Completed. Close the order in Kledo "
"manually if needed."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: tagihan Kledo dibuat tanpa tautan ke pesanan Kledo, jadi pesanannya "
"tidak akan tertutup otomatis. Biasanya ini karena item pesanan berubah "
"antara Processing dan Completed. Tutup pesanannya di Kledo secara manual "
"bila perlu."

#. translators: %s: Kledo sales order reference number
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:375
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: sales order %s has been closed in Kledo (fully invoiced)."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pesanan penjualan %s sudah ditutup di Kledo (seluruhnya tertagih)."

