msgstr ""
"Kledo: %1$s ditolak oleh Kledo (HTTP %2$d): %3$s. Ini tidak akan dicoba "
"ulang otomatis — perbaiki datanya, lalu kirim ulang dari WooCommerce > Kledo "
"> Transactions."

#. translators: 1: transaction type (order/invoice), 2: HTTP status code, 3: API error message
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:352
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: admin manual push for %1$s was rejected by Kledo (HTTP %2$d): %3$s. "
"Retrying will not help until the data is corrected."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pengiriman manual oleh admin untuk %1$s ditolak oleh Kledo (HTTP "
"%2$d): %3$s. Mengulang tidak akan menolong sampai datanya diperbaiki."

#. translators: 1: transaction type (order/invoice), 2: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: failed to send %1$s to Kledo (HTTP %2$d). Will retry automatically."
msgstr "Kledo: gagal mengirim %1$s (HTTP %2$d). Akan dicoba ulang otomatis."

#. translators: 1: type, 2: HTTP code
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:369
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: admin manual push failed for %1$s (HTTP %2$d)."
msgstr "Kledo: pengiriman manual gagal untuk %1$s (HTTP %2$d)."

#. translators: 1: type, 2: error detail
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:407
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: error when sending %1$s to Kledo: %2$s. Will retry automatically."
msgstr "Kledo: error saat mengirim %1$s: %2$s. Akan dicoba ulang otomatis."

#. translators: 1: type, 2: error
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:415
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: admin manual push error for %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "Kledo: error manual push untuk %1$s: %2$s"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:605
msgid "Waiting for Kledo to finish creating the sales order."
msgstr "Menunggu Kledo selesai membuat sales order."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:606
msgid "Waiting for the Kledo sales order to be created first."
msgstr "Menunggu sales order Kledo dibuat lebih dulu."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:616
msgid ""
"Kledo: the invoice is waiting for Kledo to finish creating its sales order. "
"Kledo accepted the sales order but has not processed it yet, and an invoice "
"sent before it exists could never be linked to it. The invoice will be sent "
"automatically as soon as the sales order is there."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: invoice sedang menunggu Kledo selesai membuat sales order-nya. Kledo "
"sudah menerima sales order tersebut tetapi belum memprosesnya, dan invoice "
"yang dikirim sebelum sales order itu ada tidak akan pernah bisa ditautkan "
"padanya. Invoice akan dikirim otomatis begitu sales order-nya tersedia."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:617
msgid ""
"Kledo: the invoice was held back because its sales order could not be "
"created in Kledo yet. Sending the invoice now would leave it permanently "
"unlinked. Both will be retried automatically, sales order first."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: invoice ditahan karena sales order-nya belum berhasil dibuat di "
"Kledo. Mengirim invoice sekarang akan membuatnya tidak pernah tertaut "
"selamanya. Keduanya akan dicoba ulang otomatis, sales order lebih dulu."

#. translators: %s: transaction type (order/invoice)
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:330
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: automatic retry for %s has stopped: maximum queue lifetime reached. "
"Manual retry is still available from the Transactions screen."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: retry otomatis untuk %s dihentikan: batas waktu antrian tercapai. "
"Retry manual masih tersedia."

#. translators: 1: transaction type (order/invoice), 2: attempts count
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:355
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: automatic retry for %1$s has stopped after %2$d failed attempts. "
"Manual retry is still available from the Transactions screen."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: retry otomatis untuk %1$s dihentikan setelah %2$d kali gagal. Retry "
"manual masih tersedia."

#. translators: 1: transaction type (order/invoice), 2: attempts count
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:382
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: successfully resent %1$s to Kledo after %2$d attempt(s)."
msgstr "Kledo: %1$s berhasil dikirim ulang setelah %2$d percobaan."

#. translators: %d: number of checks made
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:411
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the sales order after %d checks. The invoice has "
"not been sent, because linking it now is no longer possible. Check the order "
"in Kledo, then resend from WooCommerce > Kledo > Transactions."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu sales order setelah %d kali pemeriksaan. Invoice "
"tidak dikirim, karena penautannya sudah tidak mungkin dilakukan sekarang. "
"Periksa order tersebut di Kledo, lalu kirim ulang dari WooCommerce > Kledo > "
"Transactions."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:417
msgid "The Kledo sales order never appeared, so the invoice was not sent."
msgstr "Sales order Kledo tidak pernah muncul, sehingga invoice tidak dikirim."

#. translators: 1: transaction type (order/invoice), 2: API error message
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: automatic retry for %1$s has stopped because Kledo rejected the data: "
"%2$s. Correct the data, then retry manually from the Transactions screen."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: percobaan ulang otomatis untuk %1$s dihentikan karena Kledo menolak "
"datanya: %2$s. Perbaiki datanya, lalu coba ulang manual dari layar "
"Transactions."

#. translators: 1,2: anchor tags for WooCommerce > Kledo.
